@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5180

### Ping — proves routing and serialization. Not a probe; see /alive and /health below.
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/ping
Accept: application/json

### Greeting — valid request
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/greetings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada",
  "age": 36
}

### Greeting — valid, age omitted
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/greetings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada"
}

### Greeting — invalid, expect 400 ValidationProblem
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/greetings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "age": 500
}

### Greeting — reserved name, expect 409 ProblemDetails with a traceId
# The worked example of a failure that is returned, not thrown. See docs/errors-and-failures.md.
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/greetings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "admin"
}

### Liveness probe — body is the aggregate status only, never check names
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/alive

### Readiness probe
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/health

### The OpenAPI document this API serves (also committed as src/Api/openapi.json)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
